<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-WORLD CUP THIRD ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WORLD CUP THIRD ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SOMERSET WEST, South Africa 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Early third</p>
<p>round scores in the World Cup of Golf on Saturday:</p>
<p>443  England (Jim Payne 71 76 74, Peter Mitchell 78, 75 69)</p>
<p>447  Japan (Tommy Nakajima 78 75 72, Katsunori Kuwabara 74 74</p>
<p>     74)</p>
<p>449  Taiwan(Liang Hsi-Chen 73 76 77, Tse-Peng Chang 73 76 74)</p>
<p>458  Jamaica (Delroy Cambridge 72 78 73, Seymour Rose 82 74 79);</p>
<p>     Puerto Rico (Miguel Suarez 74 77 74, Wilfredo Morales 76 79 78)</p>
<p>459  Sri Lanka (Tissa Chandradasa 83 79 76, Nandesena Perera 76</p>
<p>     71 74)</p>
<p>462  Czech Republic (Jiri Janda 71 81 74, Peter Mruzek 78 76 82)</p>
<p>465  Hong Kong (Derek Fund 80 75 75, Man Kee Tang 74 82 79)</p>
<p>489  Venezuela (Henrique Lavie 78 81 72, Frederico Sauce 79 83</p>
<p>     76)</p>
<p>Disqualified on Friday:</p>
<p>298  Chile (Guillermo Encine 77 73, Roy Mackenzie 73, 75) for</p>
<p>signing an incorrect card</p>
<p>435 Namibia  (Trevor Dodds 70 70 74,  Schalk van der Merwe 76 76 69)</p>
<p>439 Italy (Manuel Zerman 72 78 75, Costantino Rocca 71 71 72)</p>
<p>441 Australia (Bradley Hughes 75 74 77, Stuart Appleby 74 71 70)</p>
<p>442 Zimbabwe (Mark McNulty 72 71 72, Tony Johnstone 79 76 72)</p>
<p>444 New Zealand (Philip Tataurangi 74 74 73, Paul Devenport 73 77 73), Spain (Diego Borrego 71 76 78, Ignacio Garrido 74 75 70),</p>
<p>Ireland (Darren Clarke 71 75 76, Padraig Harrington 74 75 73)</p>
<p>449 Paraguay (Ramon Franco 75 74 77, Gregorio Nelson Cabrera 74 74 75)</p>
</text>
